<section class="app">
  <div class="intro">
    <h2>Just navigation</h2>
    <p>
      The app does one thing: guides you on a bike. It doesn&rsquo;t track your
      commute, doesn&rsquo;t show ads, doesn&rsquo;t push a subscription, and doesn&rsquo;t
      mine your location history. It&rsquo;s just a navigation tool.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="carousel" id="carousel">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="phone-frame">
        <img src="/nav.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <h3>Turn-by-turn navigation</h3>
        <p>Clear, glanceable directions. The map stays heading-up while riding.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
